.Dd November 17, 2026
.Dt STATX 2
.Os Project9
.Sh NAME
.Nm statx ,
.Nm fstatx
.Nd get inode metadata and permissions
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In types.h
.In stat.h
.In user.h
.Ft int
.Fn statx "const char *path" "struct statx *info"
.Ft int
.Fn fstatx "int fd" "struct statx *info"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
These functions return the original stat fields in
.Va st
and the inode's
.Va uid ,
.Va gid
and
.Va mode .
.Fn statx
requires search access along the path.
.Fn fstatx
takes a descriptor referring to an inode.
.Sh RETURN VALUES
The functions return 0 on success or -1 on failure.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr chmod 1 ,
.Xr chown 1
